{"id":"wb-6-315","name":"石家大院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"石家大院","text":"石家大院，又称“尊美堂”，位于天津市杨柳青镇估衣街47号，始建于1875年，为当时“天津八大家”之一石万程的第四子石元士的宅院。目前，石家大院被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，被天津市人民政府批准为天津市文物保护单位和特殊保护等级历史风貌建筑。石家大院现为天津杨柳青博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%B6%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%A2","revisionId":93055858,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93055858","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/14f1053d16b036c5325379f0.jpg","title":"西青石家大院.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A5%BF%E9%9D%92%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%B6%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/%E8%A5%BF%E9%9D%92%E7%9F%B3%E5%AE%B6%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"KangTyngrwey","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西青石家大院","width":320,"height":269}}